        {
            "texttype":"Online",
            "textpurpose":"Description",
            "textentryhtml":"Fire-polished, rounded, flaring rim; cylindrical neck, wider at bottom than at top;\r\nspherical body; concave bottom. Blue base ring, to which has been added a lump of glass that makes the jug unstable. Blue strap handle with five ridges from shoulder to rim. Blue thread wound below the rim, and another thread wound four times at the lower part of the neck and on the horizontal shoulder. At the center of the bottom is an annular pontil mark, 1.5 cm. wide.",
            "remarks":"Fire and Sand (2012)"
